\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Clone-generation results on the industrial measurement and control corpus. Twelve programs $\times $ three seeds $=$ 36 runs per configuration; equivalence confirmation is over Categories\nobreakspace  {}C and\nobreakspace  {}D only (18 runs per configuration). Repair iterations are \emph  {VCA}-triggered stage re-entries, summed over all runs. \emph  {Takeaway:} the conventional measures do not distinguish the three configurations---the ablation scores highest on two of them---which motivates the independent review reported in Table\nobreakspace  {}\G@refundefinedtrue \text  {\normalfont  \bfseries  ??}\GenericWarning  {               }{LaTeX Warning: Reference `tab:judge' on page 6 undefined}.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:generation_results}{{1}{6}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Blind review of all 108 generated clones by an independent, stronger model with every system-identifying marker removed. The clean rate excludes \textsc  {no-op} clones, which attempted nothing. One single-shot run has no verdict---the reviewer returned an empty completion on four attempts with exponential backoff---so that configuration's denominator is 35.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:judge}{{2}{6}}
\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {subsubsection}{\numberline {2.4.1}Blind Review of Every Clone}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{sec:blindreview}{{2.4.1}{6}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Precision of each configuration's own success signal. Of the clones a configuration certified as an accepted migration, the fraction the blind reviewer found to carry \textsc  {broken} or \textsc  {major} defects. Accepting more clones and accepting sound clones are different capabilities, and on this corpus they trade off against one another.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:precision}{{3}{7}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces (a) Every run classified by the blind reviewer. (b) The trade-off: the configuration accepting the most clones ships the highest fraction of defective ones. Read either panel alone and the ranking inverts, which is why both are shown.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:results}{{1}{7}}
